    "Id": "vehicledef_DEVASTATOR_LAC",
    "Name": "Devastator DVE-6L-M1",
    "Details": "The third generation of the Demolisher, the Devastator was found mainly among the defense forces of the richer planets in the Inner Sphere. This updated version mounts two modernized Light AC/20, the weight savings allowing a significant increase in armor. Also in the turret are a quartet of ER Small lasers, and four Streak SRM-2 in the bow. These weapons generally considered short range, but the DVE-6L's targeting systems have been heavily optimized to push their limits.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       330     40\n<b>Left</b>         280     40\n<b>Right</b>       280     40\n<b>Rear</b>        225     40\n<b>Turret</b>      265     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      1380    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
    "Icon": "Devastator"
  },
